{"parentUuid":"fd2eb7c4-aab2-4c7b-9ff0-e51235ea8d77","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"ab0787721db5ca990","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VnYFYfsBcwVVZcVeGgKeV1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"INFORMS 2025 Atlanta logic-based Benders decomposition scheduling cluster session\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Planning and Scheduling by Logic-Based Benders Decomposition | Operations Research\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/opre.1060.0371\"},{\"title\":\"Critical-Path-Search Logic-Based Benders Decomposition Approaches for Flexible Job Shop Scheduling | INFORMS Journal on Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/ijoo.2021.0056\"},{\"title\":\"Novel Formulations and Logic-Based Benders Decomposition for the Integrated Parallel Machine Scheduling and Location Problem | INFORMS Journal on Computing\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/ijoc.2021.1113\"},{\"title\":\"Stochastic Planning and Scheduling with Logic-Based Benders Decomposition | INFORMS Journal on Computing\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/ijoc.2022.1184\"},{\"title\":\"Using Logic-Based Benders Decomposition to Solve the Capacity- and Distance-Constrained Plant Location Problem | INFORMS Journal on Computing\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/abs/10.1287/ijoc.1110.0458\"},{\"title\":\"A Logic-Based Benders Decomposition for the Car Resequencing Problem with a Painted Body Storage | INFORMS Journal on Computing\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/ijoc.2024.0904\"},{\"title\":\"Benders Decomposition for Simultaneous Aircraft Routing and Crew Scheduling | Transportation Science\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/trsc.35.4.375.10432\"},{\"title\":\"Logic-Based Benders Decomposition for Integrated Process Configuration and Production Planning Problems | INFORMS Journal on Computing\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/abs/10.1287/ijoc.2021.1079\"},{\"title\":\"Enhanced logic-based Benders decomposition methods for the distributed heterogeneous non-permutation flow shop scheduling problem: International Journal of Production Research: Vol 63 , No 24 - Get Access\",\"url\":\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/00207543.2025.2553820?mi=ik0enr\"},{\"title\":\"Planning and Scheduling by Logic-Based Benders ...\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/pdf/10.1287/opre.1060.0371\"}]\n\nThe search results provide extensive academic literature about logic-based Benders decomposition applied to scheduling and planning problems, with many articles published in INFORMS journals. However, the results don't contain specific information about an INFORMS 2025 Atlanta conference session on this topic.\n\nThe search results show that logic-based Benders decomposition is a well-established technique in operations research with numerous applications to scheduling problems. The method combines mixed-integer linear programming and constraint programming, with tasks allocated to facilities using MILP and scheduled using CP, linked via logic-based Benders decomposition.\n\nHowever, I was unable to find specific details about a cluster session at INFORMS 2025 in Atlanta focused on logic-based Benders decomposition and scheduling. To get information about the conference program and specific sessions, I recommend:\n\n1. Visiting the official INFORMS 2025 Atlanta conference website\n2. Checking the conference program schedule directly\n3. Contacting INFORMS directly for session information\n\nWould you like me to search for more specific information about INFORMS 2025 Atlanta, or do you have additional details about the session organizers or speakers you'd like me to search for?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"7996cf0e-f211-48ca-89a6-a149f1bc211f","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:03.608Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fd2eb7c4-aab2-4c7b-9ff0-e51235ea8d77","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"716f517f-02a7-47a8-88c0-7c3e17fbd883","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"ab0787721db5ca990","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YXYwNW5c5mfaTyPa1nA5rV","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"EURO 2025 Leeds OR conference 2D cutting packing CP-SAT industrial\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"EURO 2025 Leeds\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/events/euro-2025-leeds\"},{\"title\":\"EURO 2025 Leeds - Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/event/euro-2025-leeds\"},{\"title\":\"31st International Conference on Principles and Practice of Constraint Programming (CP 2025)\",\"url\":\"https://drops.dagstuhl.de/entities/volume/LIPIcs-volume-340\"},{\"title\":\"Optimizing 2D Cutting: A Bin Packing Approach to Minimize ...\",\"url\":\"https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol340-cp2025/LIPIcs.CP.2025.7/LIPIcs.CP.2025.7.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"EURO 2025 | ORS\",\"url\":\"https://www.theorsociety.com/ORS/ORS/Events/2025/EURO-2025/EURO-2025.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"EURO 2025\",\"url\":\"https://euro2025leeds.uk/\"},{\"title\":\"EURO Conference (Jun 2025), Leeds UK - Conference\",\"url\":\"https://10times.com/e1ds-35pd-17sf-d\"},{\"title\":\"EURO 2025 Leeds | GRAFO Research Group\",\"url\":\"https://grafo.etsii.urjc.es/en/event/euroleeds2025/\"},{\"title\":\"EURO 2025\",\"url\":\"https://www.gams.com/conferences/2025-06-euro_leeds-uk/\"},{\"title\":\"The SAT Competition - CP 2025\",\"url\":\"https://cp2025.a4cp.org/competitions.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found related to your query about EURO 2025 Leeds and topics involving 2D cutting, packing, CP-SAT, and industrial applications:\n\n## EURO 2025 Leeds Conference\n\nEURO 2025 took place at the University of Leeds from June 22-25, 2025, celebrating the 50th anniversary of EURO (the Association of European Operational Research Societies).\n\n## 2D Cutting and Packing Research\n\nThe search results reveal relevant research on 2D cutting and packing problems:\n\nA constraint programming model was developed in collaboration with an industrial partner in construction to minimize scrap waste when cutting insulation pieces, with an objective function designed to maximize the reusability of leftover material. This work titled \"Optimizing 2D Cutting: A Bin Packing Approach to Minimize Scraps and Maximize Their Reusability\" was presented at the 31st International Conference on Principles and Practice of Constraint Programming (CP 2025).\n\n## CP-SAT in Industrial Applications\n\nA local search solver used CP-SAT to solve travelling salesman problems with time windows to schedule observations and downloads for an agile Earth observation satellite constellation.\n\n## Conference Presentations\n\nHexaly presented optimization solutions at EURO 2025 with improvements for solving routing, scheduling, packing, and supply chain optimization problems.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"981525fa-ee1f-40b7-98f4-ee82dca1036f","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:05.843Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"716f517f-02a7-47a8-88c0-7c3e17fbd883","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"981525fa-ee1f-40b7-98f4-ee82dca1036f","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ab0787721db5ca990","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01SWqC1eVXr8ggQ9qW6GTDx3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have sufficient material to compile the report.\n\n## CP 2025 (5 篇)\n- [Conflict Analysis Based on Cutting-Planes for Constraint Programming (CP 2025)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/entities/document/10.4230/LIPIcs.CP.2025.4): LLG（Lazy Linear Generation），冲突分析里直接生成线性整数不等式而不是子句，45% 实例减少冲突数。影响项目: **新方向 watchlist** — 我们的 binding/routing cuts 现在是逻辑 cuts，LLG 提供了\"线性 cut + LCG 回退\"的混合范式可借鉴。\n- [Anytime and Exact Search for Planning Problems (CP 2025 Invited)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/entities/document/10.4230/LIPIcs.CP.2025.2): Solnon 综述如何在 DP 状态图上结合 A*/CP/LS 做 anytime + exact 搜索。影响项目: **直接相关** — ε-Certified 三阶段就是 anytime + exact，这是综述级别 reference。\n- [Dependency-Curated Large Neighbourhood Search (CP 2025)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/entities/document/10.4230/LIPIcs.CP.2025.20): Uppsala 团队 LNS + CBLS，按依赖图筛邻域。影响项目: **watchlist** — 168h 长跑的 master neighborhood 重构候选。\n- [Optimizing 2D Cutting: Bin Packing to Minimize Scraps (CP 2025)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/entities/document/10.4230/LIPIcs.CP.2025.7): Quimper 组工业切割 CP 模型，最大化余料可重用性。影响项目: **直接相关** — 2D placement + 余料利用对应我们的 ghost rectangle 角度。\n- [Parallel MIP Solving with Dynamic Task Decomposition (CP 2025)](https://cp2025.a4cp.org/accepted_papers.html): 动态任务分解的并行 MIP。影响项目: **watchlist** — exact_parallel_scheduler 的并行策略对照参考。\n\n## SAT 2025 (3 篇)\n- [Practically Feasible Proof Logging for Pseudo-Boolean Optimization (CP 2025 #34, joint SAT track)](https://cp2025.a4cp.org/accepted_papers.html): VeriPB 落地 PB 优化的可行性证明。影响项目: **新方向 watchlist** — ε-Certified 长期可考虑加证书产物。\n- [Streamlining Distributed SAT Solver Design (SAT 2025)](https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.SAT.2025.27): Schreiber 等，分布式 SAT 架构精简。影响项目: **无直接** — 我们 168h 单机为主，纯 reference。\n- [SLS-Enhanced Core-Boosted Linear Search for Anytime MaxSAT (CP 2025 #27)](https://cp2025.a4cp.org/accepted_papers.html): SLS + core-boost 的 anytime MaxSAT。影响项目: **watchlist** — anytime 思路对应 ε-Certified 阶段切换。\n\n## CPAIOR 2025 (2 篇)\n- [Multi-task Representation Learning for MILP (CPAIOR 2025 Best Paper, Junyang Cai)](https://www.ai4opt.org/news-events/ai4opt-researchers-present-optimization-advances-and-win-awards-cpaior-2025): MILP 多任务表征学习。影响项目: **无直接** — 我们的 AI 是 shadow sidecar，但表征学习思路可启发候选 ordering。\n- [QC4UC: Quantum-Classical Hybrid with Benders Cut Generation (Barrass, CPAIOR 2025)](https://www.ai4opt.org/news-events/ai4opt-researchers-present-optimization-advances-and-win-awards-cpaior-2025): 量子退火 + 经典 Benders cut 在 unit commitment。影响项目: **无** — 量子硬件依赖。\n- 第三篇未找到 — CPAIOR 2025 完整 LNCS 15762/15763 列表需 Springer 鉴权访问，公开来源未列出 LBBD-specific paper。\n\n## INFORMS / EURO 2025 (1 篇)\n- [Enhanced LBBD for Distributed Heterogeneous Non-Permutation Flow Shop (IJPR 2025, Vol.63 No.24)](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/00207543.2025.2553820): LBBD 在分布式异构流水车间的工程加速（cuts + warm-start）。影响项目: **直接相关** — 跟我们 binding/routing/flow 三层 LBBD 同构，可借鉴其 cut 加强 + warm-start 工程技巧。\n- INFORMS 2025（Atlanta, 10/26-29）和 EURO 2025（Leeds, 6/22-25）公开 search 拿不到 session-level program；找不到具体匹配 paper（不是没有，是公开 indexable 资料里查不到）。\n\n## arXiv H2 (2 篇)\n- [Graph-Based Imitation and RL for Efficient Benders Decomposition (arXiv 2511.11870, 2025-11)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.11870): GNN policy + IL→RL 两阶段训练加速 Benders。影响项目: **watchlist** — AI sidecar order_only 边界内可借鉴。\n- [Benders Decomposition using Graph Modeling and Multi-Parametric Programming (arXiv 2508.01100)](https://arxiv.org/html/2508.01100): 图建模 + 多参数规划重构 Benders。影响项目: **watchlist**。\n- \"anytime CP-SAT industrial placement\" 精确组合在 arXiv 2025 H2 找不到匹配——仅限 abstract 级关联（PyJobShop、ConstraintLLM 工业基准等，主题不直接对口）。\n\n## 总结\n- **改变路线图的 paper**：无。所有发现都对得上现有方向，没有否定 ε-Certified / LBBD / cut 持久化 / shadow AI 的证据。\n- **加 watchlist 的 paper**：5 篇（LLG、Solnon anytime 综述、DC-LNS、QC4UC 不取、IJPR LBBD 工程加速、GNN-Benders RL）。\n- **直接可落地**：1 篇 — IJPR 2025 增强 LBBD 论文跟我们三层 LBBD 工程同构，cut 加强/warm-start 技巧值得读完后挑能搬的实验，归到 P1 或 P2 实验列。\n- **Solnon 的 anytime 综述**值得作为 ε-Certified 路线图引用 anchor（不动方向，但有学术 framing）。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5402,"cache_read_input_tokens":48018,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5402,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cassf29JZGQXYAVFjhiQD","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"a8d6183a-a9b4-40d4-8222-00fde84fc3e0","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:49.509Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
